# EGM's skills are not self-contained. All seven cite files outside skills/
# relative to the plugin root: egm-review, egm-review-loop, egm-brainstorm and
# egm-bootstrap dispatch their reviewer prompts under agents/, egm-review,
# egm-review-loop and egm-draft apply the scoring standards under
# resources/document_standards/, and every one points at the adaptation guides
# in docs/. So the pack declares those companions rather than shipping skills
# whose instructions point at files that are not in the mount.
#
# The docs entries are single files on purpose. Upstream docs/ also holds a
# 296 KB designs/ tree (EGM's own internal design notes), and the repo carries a
# 2.1 MB site/ build and an assets/ tree — none of which a skill reads.
# docs/designs/<feature>.md inside a SKILL.md means the USER's repository output
# directory, not this pack. The composed bundle is 400 KB against 88 entries.
# shellcheck disable=SC2034
PLUGIN_NAME=egm
PLUGIN_VERSION_SOURCE=plugin.json
PLUGIN_SKILLS_SRC=skills
PLUGIN_SKILLS_LIST=deploy/kagent/egm/skills.txt
PLUGIN_EXTRA_PATHS="agents resources docs/claude.md docs/codex.md docs/harnesses.md"
PLUGIN_DESCRIPTION="Elephant-Goldfish Model design and fresh-eyes review workflow, packaged for kagent"
